export default "<h1>Delete your Regulated account</h1>\n<p>Last updated: 31 October 2026</p>\n<p>This page explains how to delete your account for Regulated. Regulated is a guided audio app for wind-down and nervous-system routines. It is published by Advanced Communication Techniques Pty Ltd, South Australia, Australia, and presented with Matthew Tweedie Hypnosis.</p>\n<h2>Before you delete: cancel your subscription</h2>\n<p>Deleting your account does not cancel a Google Play subscription. Cancel it first.</p>\n<p>To cancel in Google Play: open the Play Store, then Payments and subscriptions, then Subscriptions.</p>\n<p>Website subscriptions are cancelled through Regulated: email info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au.</p>\n<h2>How to ask for deletion</h2>\n<p>Choose one of these options.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In the app: sign in, then open the You tab and tap Request account deletion.</li>\n<li>On the web, without the app: sign in on this page and send the request.</li>\n<li>By email: write to info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au from your account's email address.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>What happens</h2>\n<p>We complete deletion requests within 30 days of receiving them.</p>\n<p>Your account and its associated data are deleted. We ask our service providers to delete your data too.</p>\n<h2>What is kept after deletion</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Payment and tax records: kept for 5 years, as Australian tax law requires.</li>\n<li>Support messages and notes: kept for 7 years as clinical records. They are kept securely, then deleted.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Copies in provider backups and logs are removed on those providers' own schedules.</p>\n<h2>Questions</h2>\n<p>Email info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au.</p>"
